        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Puzzle Unfolds to the Rhythm</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br>Drill Beat</strong> is a <strong>puzzle-rhythm</strong> game where movement is driven by <strong>music</strong>. You control an <strong>animated drill bit</strong> that can only move <strong>to the beat</strong>, challenging you to <strong>time every step</strong>. Navigate through a series of <strong>intricate puzzles</strong>, avoid <strong>hazards</strong>, and find the <strong>best path forward</strong> as you collect <strong>golden cogs</strong> to unlock new stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you <strong>descend deeper</strong> into this <strong>mechanical world</strong>, the puzzles grow <strong>more complex</strong>, requiring a mix of <strong>rhythm, strategy, and quick thinking</strong>. With a unique blend of <strong>timing-based movement</strong> and <strong>puzzle-solving</strong>, Drill Beat delivers a <strong>fresh and engaging experience</strong> for players who enjoy both <strong>rhythm and logic-based challenges</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you make it to the bottom?</strong></p>",
